  is 1.

  This function performs the equivalent of

  ```python
  softmax = tf.exp(logits) / tf.reduce_sum(tf.exp(logits), axis, keepdims=True)
  ```
  Example usage:

  >>> softmax = tf.nn.softmax([-1, 0., 1.])
